      "message": "Hmmm... I think this has been fixed since https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/252929 some time ago? It looks like the behavior generally should be to call `beginLine`, `commitRunInfo` (to indicate there are no runs, seems fine since the implementation here is to do nothing), then `endLine`.\n\nHowever, it looks like maybe the test currently never runs? It appears to all be `ifdef`ed out based on `SKSHAPER_IMPLEMENTATION` which is never set for this test? This test should be moved under `modules/skshaper` and put in its own target enabled by the module being built.",
